1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,260
Now, let's talk about acquisition channels for our product.

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:07,260
What is exactly the acquisition channel?

3
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:11,775
The acquisition channel is the way your customers get to your product.

4
00:00:11,775 --> 00:00:16,680
There are different type of acquisition channels; organic,

5
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:21,730
the user find you on their own their own way and viral channels,

6
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:25,395
where users find us based on recommendations from others.

7
00:00:25,395 --> 00:00:27,900
This can be free or paid.

8
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:32,070
To get recommendation, we can use SEO or search engine optimization,

9
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:34,170
or other paid advertising methods.

10
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:36,910
Today, there are new ways to acquire customers.

11
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:38,990
For example, getting featured by Apple.

12
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:42,300
It is amazing way to get your users to see your product.

13
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:45,835
But getting that featured spot is a very long shot.

14
00:00:45,835 --> 00:00:51,350
Influencers on social media sites like Instagram can also be very effective,

15
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:54,865
but can be challenging to get them interested in your product.

16
00:00:54,865 --> 00:00:56,810
Rankings can help too.

17
00:00:56,810 --> 00:00:59,645
If you dramatically increase your downloads for your mobile app,

18
00:00:59,645 --> 00:01:01,280
the jump in ranking can give you

19
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:06,355
more visibility and then your downloads will increase again as a result of that jump.

20
00:01:06,355 --> 00:01:08,810
You will work with your marketing partner to find and

21
00:01:08,810 --> 00:01:11,525
define the best acquisition channels for your product.

22
00:01:11,525 --> 00:01:14,555
How can you do that? What will be the process?

23
00:01:14,555 --> 00:01:18,605
We will start by creating a comprehensive document for your marketing team,

24
00:01:18,605 --> 00:01:22,555
where you will outline all the details about your product.

25
00:01:22,555 --> 00:01:25,985
We will need to provide our marketing team deals in our product,

26
00:01:25,985 --> 00:01:27,875
its goals and problems we're solving,

27
00:01:27,875 --> 00:01:30,215
and how we're solving this problems.

28
00:01:30,215 --> 00:01:35,335
That will help marketers find the best channels for us to acquire users.

29
00:01:35,335 --> 00:01:40,415
We should also think through our marketing budget and where we want to spend our money.

30
00:01:40,415 --> 00:01:46,075
We should always evaluate the channel has the best results versus money ratio.

31
00:01:46,075 --> 00:01:49,235
Working together with your product marketing manager,

32
00:01:49,235 --> 00:01:52,340
you can develop an effective channel strategy that ensures that

33
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:56,820
your users will find you and you will find your users.

